                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's fine, but I felt myself feeling bored most of the time and it felt like a slog to get through the story because of how interactions were designed. Very predictable responses and a lot of the time, the answers simply didn't have enough variance or impact on the story for me to feel replayability despite there being \"multiple endings\" (it's really just 2 endings, bad ending, and a good ending, with both good endings being virtually the same, just replace the name and a few small details)\r\n\r\nNot really worth paying for.",
